I can completely understand your confusion. I was demonstrating to a student that sometimes you need to load a corpus file, get the relevant data, then write it to a file using append=T, get the next file, etc. The snippet of code I included in my first message was just demonstrating how to write a file line-by-line to show the problem I encountered in doing so.

